## Heavy equipment repairs and services

We take on the full range of Class 7 repair work:

- Hydraulic system repairs
- Suspension system repairs
- Oil and fluid
- Brake system repairs
- Wheel and axle repairs

## Why bring it here

Large machinery does not fail the way a truck does. The loads are higher, the
duty cycles are rougher, and a hydraulic circuit has no warning light. Our
technicians have spent years on equipment this size and diagnose it with the
tools it needs rather than the ones a truck bay happens to have, which is what
keeps a machine working and its service life long.

